{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Structural reformers in the Warren lane.">Progressive</span>!}: [+ primary_delegate_share_progressive +]%

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Union-rooted, materially focused.">Labor Left</span>!}: [+ primary_delegate_share_labor_left +]%

